        "y1": 0.5573013288992543
      },
      "text": "3 (14.3%)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5677450618732361,
        "y0": 0.5454729121516568,
        "x1": 0.6433669048427998,
        "y1": 0.5573013288992543
      },
      "text": "10 (47.6%)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.20342000684358175,
        "y0": 0.5870861110820447,
        "x1": 0.8847696393646155,
        "y1": 0.5989145278296422
      },
      "text": "This result showed that in the majority of intervention groups experienced the subduing of fine motor",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.6007671945593736,
        "x1": 0.8844176711938734,
        "y1": 0.612595611306971
      },
      "text": "development according to age from 4 (19.0%) Respondents to 16 (76.2%) Respondents, while in the control",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.614341362859907,
        "x1": 0.8847936302041011,
        "y1": 0.6261697796075045
      },
      "text": "group were increasing but not as much as the intervention group, it was seen from 3 (14.3%) Respondents to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.6280224100948031,
        "x1": 0.8851494943231357,
        "y1": 0.6398508268424006
      },
      "text": "10 (47.6%) which has a smooth motoic development according to age. This results in showing that brain",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.641703493572132,
        "x1": 0.885307895378713,
        "y1": 0.6535319103197295
      },
      "text": "gymnastics can affect the development of child fine motor, it can be proved in the intervention group which is",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.655384540807028,
        "x1": 0.8846183125309378,
        "y1": 0.6672129575546255
      },
      "text": "mostly motor development according to age. The research results with the Mann Whitney statistical test",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.6690655880419241,
        "x1": 0.8843507223982151,
        "y1": 0.6808940047895216
      },
      "text": "obtained a P value of 0045. Decision making is done by looking at the degree of efficacy (α = 0.05), i.e. when",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.682746671519253,
        "x1": 0.8847262713086226,
        "y1": 0.6945750882668504
      },
      "text": "the P value of < 0.05 then H0 is rejected. Current research because it is obtained by the value of < 0.05, then",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.6962852135083324,
        "x1": 0.8852514041284716,
        "y1": 0.7081136302559298
      },
      "text": "there can be a meaningful difference between the development of the fine Motoik child 4-6 than in the control",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7099662788644447,
        "x1": 0.8850652188100714,
        "y1": 0.7217946956120422
      },
      "text": "group and the intervention group seen from P value 0045 (< 0.05) so that it can be considered a therapeutic",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7236473260993408,
        "x1": 0.8851725624380257,
        "y1": 0.7354757428469383
      },
      "text": "effect of brain gymnastics for fine motor development in children aged 4-6 in the sub-district of Surodadi",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7373283914554534,
        "x1": 0.21683692227269838,
        "y1": 0.7491568082030508
      },
      "text": "subdistrict.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.19051938145693964,
        "y0": 0.7510094568115657,
        "x1": 0.8853607341774302,
        "y1": 0.7628378735591632
      },
      "text": "The increased physical complexity reflects the rapid rate of neuronal and glial growth and development",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7646905221676782,
        "x1": 0.8847018703693168,
        "y1": 0.7765189389152757
      },
      "text": "within the brain. As these cells become more complex and interconnected, brain functional capacity increases.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7782290641567575,
        "x1": 0.8843841455335667,
        "y1": 0.790057480904355
      },
      "text": "Some fundamental behavioral functions are already present at birth, implying that structural connectivity of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7919338683063619,
        "x1": 0.8845777126487316,
        "y1": 0.8037622850539594
      },
      "text": "the relevant brain circuits have begun. Examples of these early developing circuits include primary sensory",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8056149336624743,
        "x1": 0.8852088562721191,
        "y1": 0.8174433504100718
      },
      "text": "systems such as hearing, touch and pain sensation, taste and, to a lesser extent, vision. More complex behaviors",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8192959990185869,
        "x1": 0.8850388698966193,
        "y1": 0.8311244157661843
      },
      "text": "such as recognition memory, dependent in large part on hippocampal development, can even be demonstrated",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8329770643746992,
        "x1": 0.88465255586593,
        "y1": 0.8448054811222967
      },
      "text": "in the term and preterm neonate. Other brain functions that are being supported through this burst of circuit",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8465156063637786,
        "x1": 0.8811417938295987,
        "y1": 0.8583440231113761
      },
      "text": "development and connectivity do not have obvious behavioral manifestations at birth. Despite the lack of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8601966626592829,
        "x1": 0.8845010239823421,
        "y1": 0.8720250794068803
      },
      "text": "behavioral manifestations, the neural circuits underlying more complex behaviors that will appear later in",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8738777280153953,
        "x1": 0.8853622336048981,
        "y1": 0.8857061447629928
      },
      "text": "childhood are being constructed. For example, behaviors such as working memory, set-shifting, multi-tasking,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8875587843108996,
        "x1": 0.8751002032774586,
        "y1": 0.8993872010584971
      },
      "text": "and attention that are not present in the neonate nevertheless have their neural ontogenies prior to term birth.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.9180561482189987,
        "x1": 0.30348693892767226,
        "y1": 0.9298845649665962
      },
      "text": "Proceeding homepage:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
